[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; An ice cream cone for a guest's hand. The boardwalk thief script swaps it in
; for the cup some guests already carry, and an airborne gull dives on the node
; named "scoop". Reshape or recolour it here; keep the scoop's name.

